The Fast Alert Basic Alarm is a home health product that serves as a personal protection device for both the patient and the caregiver. Often seen in hospitals and nursing homes. It is an ideal safety alarm for the elderly and anyone who needs the security of a alert system[ while sitting].
The Fast Alert Basic Patient Alarm is sold as a complete system. The Alarm and chair replacement sensor are also sold as replacement parts and can be purchased separately - see options above.
Note: Protect Fast-Alert sensor pad with waterproof disposable pad if there is risk of incontinence or liquid spills.

